She feels betrayed and she leaves.
她感到被背叛了，于是离开了。

1219
00:57:49.080 --> 00:57:49.820
She's upset.
她很心烦。

1220
00:57:50.840 --> 00:57:51.020
Yeah.
是啊。

1221
00:57:51.980 --> 00:57:57.480
Jen Salata sent in an amazing audio clip breaking down this whole scene from a director's perspective.
简·萨拉塔发来了一段精彩的音频，从导演的角度剖析了整个场景。

1222
00:57:57.700 --> 00:57:59.080
And we want you to hear it.
我们想让你听听。

1223
00:57:59.420 --> 00:58:02.800
I definitely remember there were a lot of discussions about the Pam Bryan scene.
我确实记得当时关于帕姆和布莱恩的那场戏有很多讨论。

1224
00:58:03.220 --> 00:58:10.180
