1342
01:04:20.660 --> 01:04:22.200
It was a two-person scene.
这是一场双人戏。

1343
01:04:22.320 --> 01:04:25.060
Two-person scenes are so fun because you really get to play.
双人戏非常有趣，因为你可以真正地去发挥。

1344
01:04:25.100 --> 01:04:27.280
That's how I felt about my scenes with Oscar.
我和奥斯卡的戏份也是这种感觉。

1345
01:04:27.580 --> 01:04:27.900
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1346
01:04:28.060 --> 01:04:30.000
You have a real partner.
你有一个真正的搭档。

1347
01:04:30.280 --> 01:04:30.520
Yes.
是的。

1348
01:04:30.720 --> 01:04:36.300
And the way this was set up, it really just felt like this private moment, and I loved
而且这场戏的设定，真的感觉就像是一个私密的时刻，我非常喜欢。

1349
01:04:36.300 --> 01:04:36.540
it.
我喜欢。

